1. **`std::sort`** (GCC 11.3, `-O3 -march=native`)
2. A **reasonable** custom QuickSort (median-of-3 pivot, insertion sort for small subarrays)
3. A **naive** custom QuickSort (first-element pivot, recursive until base case)

